revision            0

description         A CLI tool to find the dominant colours in an image

long_description    This is a command-line tool for finding the dominant \
                    colours of an image. It prints their hex codes to the \
                    terminal, along with a preview of the colour (in \
                    terminals that support ANSI escape codes)

